/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 119 0 R
/T (Test smells are poor testing practices that make test code hard to maintain and prone to bugs. Tools like PyNose, Pytest-smell can detect them, but developers lack prioritization guidance. TestSmellRank aims to automatically detect, evaluate and rank test smells in Python project to help developers decide which issues to fix first.  )
/E (Test smells are poor testing practices that make test code hard to maintain and prone to bugs. Tools like PyNose, Pytest-smell can detect them, but developers lack prioritization guidance. TestSmellRank aims to automatically detect, evaluate and rank test smells in Python project to help developers decide which issues to fix first.  )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
